# ref-into-split root
library "Root".
include "Multi".

// Root qualified-refs into "Multi"."Leaf Concept". But "Multi" is a MULTI-LAYER
// library that emit auto-splits into "Multi Concepts" / "Multi Asserted", so
// the original "Multi" library will not exist. This must fail LOUDLY (referrer
// re-qualification is a later slice), not emit a dangling reference.
concept "Root Concept":
- type is Observation.
- value type is boolean.
- defined as "Multi"."Leaf Concept".
